  "body": "Postgres 12 introduces a way for connections to interrogate the status of a `CREATE INDEX` in progress, see https://www.postgresql.org/docs/12/progress-reporting.html\r\n\r\nIt would be great to have background index creation periodically query this data and store it in the background_updates table, so we have a way to get some feedback on how index creation is going.",
